      <data key="d12">104</data>
      <data key="d13">117</data>
      <data key="d14">class Identity:</data>
      <data key="d15">Who made a request, as far as the server can tell.

    Attributes:
        subject: The token's `sub` claim under OIDC, "anonymous" with no auth
            configured, or "bearer" for a shared static token, which by
            construction identifies no one in particular.
        mode: Which authentication mode admitted this request.
        claims: The validated JWT claims, empty for the other two modes.</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
