      <data key="d14">def key_for(self, kid: str) -&gt; dict[str, Any]:</data>
      <data key="d15">Return the JWK with this `kid`, refetching under a per-window cap.

        Args:
            kid: The key id from the token header.

        Returns:
            The matching JWK as a dict.

        Raises:
            AuthError: If the key is unknown after any allowed refetch.</data>
