      <data key="d14">def _neighbour_edge(target: str, edge: dict, direction: str) -&gt; dict:</data>
      <data key="d15">Structured form of a callers/callees/bases entry.

    Additive sibling of the callers/callees/callees_external string lists --
    same targets, plus the edge type, direction and (only when &lt; 1.0, to keep
    the common case small) confidence. IMPORTS/DEFINES/INHERITS edges carry no
    confidence key, so they fall through the 1.0 default and are never flagged.</data>
