      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">848</data>
      <data key="d13">862</data>
      <data key="d14">def _unit_float(value: str) -&gt; float:</data>
      <data key="d15">argparse type: a finite float in [0.0, 1.0].

    A bare float() would accept nan and inf, and `confidence &lt; nan` is False for
    every edge — the filter would silently stop filtering.</data>
