      <data key="d12">108</data>
      <data key="d13">117</data>
      <data key="d14">def timestamp() -&gt; str:</data>
      <data key="d15">An ISO-8601 UTC timestamp with millisecond precision.

    Returns:
        e.g. `"2026-09-16T10:31:07.482Z"`. Milliseconds rather than
        microseconds because that is what the audit record format specifies and
        what most SIEM ingesters expect.</data>
