    <node id="sym:repo2graph/export.py::_xml_safe">
      <data key="d0">sym:repo2graph/export.py::_xml_safe</data>
      <data key="d1">symbol</data>
      <data key="d2">_xml_safe</data>
      <data key="d10">_xml_safe</data>
      <data key="d11">function</data>
      <data key="d3">repo2graph/export.py</data>
      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">330</data>
      <data key="d13">345</data>
      <data key="d14">def _xml_safe(text: str) -&gt; str:</data>
      <data key="d15">Drop characters that are not legal in XML 1.0.

    A C0 control char (\x0b, \x0c, \x00) sitting in a docstring or signature
    is written verbatim by ElementTree and then makes the file unparseable by
    any conforming reader (ISS-27). Legal set: tab, LF, CR, &gt;=0x20 minus the
    surrogate block, up to 0x10FFFF, excluding 0xFFFE/0xFFFF.</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry x="118.80" y="811.35" width="88.88" height="29.25" />
          <y:Fill color="#57C7E3" transparent="false" />
          <y:BorderStyle color="#4a4f57" type="line" width="1.0" />
          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" fontSize="11" textColor="#1c2330" visible="true">_xml_safe</y:NodeLabel>
          <y:Shape type="ellipse" />
        </y:ShapeNode>
      </data>
    </node>
