      <data key="d2">_safe_open</data>
      <data key="d10">_safe_open</data>
      <data key="d11">function</data>
      <data key="d3">repo2graph/graph.py</data>
      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">755</data>
      <data key="d13">775</data>
      <data key="d14">def _safe_open(path: Path, mode: str = "rb"):</data>
      <data key="d15">Open a file with O_NOFOLLOW where supported (ISS-87).

    Like _safe_read_bytes, but returns a file object for chunked reading
    (used by _chunk_and_parse for files larger than config.max_file_bytes).</data>
