      <data key="d13">153</data>
      <data key="d14">def colorize(line: str):</data>
      <data key="d15">Split one output line into (text, colour, bold) runs.

    Deliberately crude: it keys off the shapes repo2graph's own output uses
    (`$ ` prompts, `#` annotations, `--- id [why]` and `### [cite: ...]`
    headers) rather than pretending to be a syntax highlighter.</data>
