      <data key="d13">438</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_a_jwk_with_no_modulus_is_refused():</data>
      <data key="d15">Issue 238: kty RSA and no `n` indexed straight into the dict.

    `key["n"]` on a key set that never published one is a KeyError, and a
    KeyError is not an AuthError -- it becomes a 500 on the tool path and a
    dead handler thread on the refusal path, which catches AuthError only.</data>
