      <data key="d12">773</data>
      <data key="d13">785</data>
      <data key="d14">class FakeOpener:</data>
      <data key="d15">Stand-in for `auth._OPENER`, delegating to a urlopen-shaped callable.

    `_fetch_json` goes through an opener rather than `urlopen` so that
    `_HTTPSOnlyRedirect` cannot be bypassed; patching the opener is what keeps
    these tests off the network.</data>
