      <data key="d14">def test_list_and_dict_arguments_do_not_raise():</data>
      <data key="d15">frozenset(params.items()) raises here; canonical JSON does not.

    JSON-Schema tool arguments permit arrays and objects, so a key built from a
    frozenset of items is a TypeError waiting for the first caller who sends
    one -- which is why this cache keys on canonical JSON instead.</data>
