      <data key="d14">def test_doctor_artifact_integrity_ignores_unrelated_agent_dir(tmp_path):</data>
      <data key="d15">A top-level agent/ dir that isn't ours must not be treated as a
    broken repo2graph index.

    "agent/" and "chunks.jsonl" are generic names used by unrelated
    projects (agent frameworks, ML repos with their own chunk files). Only
    a directory carrying repo2graph's own manifest.json -- or a ".r2g"
    subdirectory, which nothing else names -- counts as ours.</data>
