      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">44</data>
      <data key="d13">57</data>
      <data key="d14">def _has_any_mcp():</data>
      <data key="d15">An SDK `serve()` can actually drive, on either major.

    `_has_mcp` above is narrower on purpose -- the tests it gates are written
    against the 1.x decorator API. `serve()` itself handles both, so a test
    that only drives it over the wire must not be skipped on a 2.x install.</data>
