      <data key="d14">def test_ai_caps_are_checked_before_the_call():</data>
      <data key="d15">Both ceilings gate the request, not the bookkeeping after it.

    `synchronize` fires on every push, so without a run cap a force-push loop
    is an unbounded bill. A cap checked after the call bounds nothing.</data>
