      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">719</data>
      <data key="d13">727</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_ac25_bad_min_conf_exits_non_zero(rag_out, bad, capsys):</data>
      <data key="d15">AC-25: argparse turns a bad --min-conf into a non-zero SystemExit that
    names the offending flag and value (not some unrelated parse error).</data>
