      <data key="d13">929</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_ac28_grounded_prompt_and_citations_reach_the_endpoint(monkeypatch):</data>
      <data key="d15">AC-28: the request body carries the grounding rules and the pack; the
    only host contacted is the provider's -- nothing real is dialled.</data>
