      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">86</data>
      <data key="d13">108</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_dense_ranking_differs_from_bm25_only(embedded_index):</data>
      <data key="d15">Fusion must actually change the ranking, or it is not doing anything.

    A rigged embedder puts the BM25 *last* candidate nearest the query. If the
    vectors reach the ranker the fused order differs from the lexical one; if
    they are dropped on the way, the two are identical -- which is exactly what
    the pre-v1.4.0 path produced.</data>
