      <data key="d14">def test_parse_multi_param_generic_bases_iss162():</data>
      <data key="d15">ISS-162: commas inside a generic's type args must not split the base list.

    `class Repo(Generic[T, U], BaseRepo)` used to split on every raw comma,
    yielding the malformed tokens ['Generic[T', 'U]', 'BaseRepo'] instead of
    the two real bases. Same bug for `&lt;...&gt;` template/generic args in
    TS/Java/C++.</data>
