      <data key="d14">def test_iss242_a_bad_format_degrades_to_bm25_end_to_end(mini_index, use_stub_embedder, capsys):</data>
      <data key="d15">ISS-242 (d): through query.Index, a format bump is indistinguishable
    from having no vectors -- nothing raises, and the pack still answers.

    The correctly-stamped load is asserted first so this cannot pass by
    fusion being dead in the fixture for some unrelated reason.</data>
